          "B) Pausing work when the tab is hidden (*)",
          "C) Form validation",
          "D) Routing",
          "Explanation: document.visibilityState tells you \"hidden\"/\"visible\" — pause video, reduce polling, save battery.",
          "Q10: ResizeObserver fires when:",
          "A) The window resizes only",
          "B) Any observed element's size changes (*)",
          "C) The user scrolls",
          "D) An image loads",
