          "A) `if (typeof x === \"number\")` (*)",
          "B) `if (x === number)`",
          "C) `if (x instanceof number)`",
          "D) `if (x is number)`",
          "Explanation: `typeof` is the standard runtime check for primitives; `instanceof` only works for class instances, not primitives.",
