          "B) link",
          "C) src",
          "D) url",
          "Explanation: The `href` (hypertext reference) attribute specifies the destination URL of a link.",
          "Q2: Why should `target=\"_blank\"` always be paired with `rel=\"noopener\"`?",
          "A) To make the link open faster",
          "B) To prevent the new page from accessing window.opener (*)",
          "C) To force HTTPS",
          "D) To add a nofollow directive",
          "Explanation: Without `noopener`, the new tab can use `window.opener` to redirect or attack the originating tab.",
