          "A) <a href=\"#\">",
          "B) <a href=\"javascript:void(0)\">",
          "C) <span onclick=\"...\">",
          "D) <button type=\"button\"> (*)",
          "Explanation: In-page actions belong in `<button>`; `<a>` is for navigation only, and `<span>` with onclick is not keyboard-accessible.",
