          "Explanation: Setting `transform`, `filter`, `opacity < 1`, `will-change`, `position: fixed/sticky`, or `z-index` on a positioned element all create stacking contexts.",
          "Q8: Why are floats no longer recommended for page layout?",
          "A) They are deprecated",
          "B) They remove elements from flow and require clearfix hacks; flex/grid are purpose-built (*)",
