          "BEM (Block Element Modifier): `block__element--modifier`",
          "OOCSS, SMACSS, ITCSS (briefly)",
          "Utility-first CSS (Tailwind) and its trade-offs",
          "CSS-in-JS (CSS Modules, styled-components, vanilla-extract) — preview",
