          "4. What is the right pool size for CPU-bound vs I/O-bound work? — CPU-bound: roughly #cores (Brian Goetz's formula: N_threads = N_cpu * U_cpu * (1 + W/C)); I/O-bound: much higher (often tens to hundreds).",
