          "A) Red: deploy, Green: rollback, Refactor: delete",
          "B) Red: stop, Green: go, Refactor: rebuild",
          "C) Red: failing test, Green: minimal pass, Refactor: improve design (*)",
          "D) Red: refactor, Green: write tests, Refactor: release",
          "Explanation: TDD's loop: write a failing test (red), make it pass with minimal code (green), then improve the design without changing behavior (refactor).",
