          "A) Functional, Iterative, Reliable, Static, Typed",
          "B) Frequent, Independent, Random, Safe, Tested",
          "C) First-class, Inheritance, Runtime, Strict, Tolerant",
          "D) Fast, Isolated, Repeatable, Self-validating, Timely (*)",
          "Explanation: FIRST = Fast, Isolated, Repeatable, Self-validating, Timely — properties of good unit tests (from Robert Martin / Kent Beck).",
