          "B) `p->member` (equivalent to `(*p).member`) (*)",
          "C) `p::member`",
          "D) `p@member`",
          "Explanation: `->` is shorthand for dereference-then-access; `p->member` is exactly `(*p).member`.",
          "Q3: What does typedef do?",
