          "B) `struct S s = new S(1, 2);`",
          "C) `struct S s = { .x = 1, .y = 2 };` (C99) (*)",
          "D) `struct S s = S{1, 2};`",
          "Explanation: C99 designated initializers name fields explicitly: `{ .field = value }`, leaving unmentioned fields zero.",
