          "Q9: What is a tagged union?",
          "A) A struct with a tag (enum/int) plus a union — the tag identifies the active member (*)",
          "B) A union with a function pointer",
          "C) A union of two tags",
          "D) A struct with a const tag",
          "Explanation: A tagged union pairs a tag with a union, letting code safely dispatch on the active member — the basis of variants.",
