          "A) Replaces PackageReference",
          "B) Disables NuGet",
          "C) Pins package versions in one file; projects reference without versions (*)",
          "D) Is automatic",
          "Explanation: With `<ManagePackageVersionsCentrally>true</ManagePackageVersionsCentrally>`, versions live in `Directory.Packages.props`; each project's `<PackageReference>` omits the version, preventing drift across the solution.",
          "Q8: `dotnet add package FluentAssertions` does what?",
          "A) Adds a project reference",
          "B) Compiles the project",
          "C) Publishes the package",
          "D) Adds a PackageReference to the .csproj and restores the package (*)",
