          "Tuple structs: `struct Color(u8, u8, u8)`",
          "Unit structs: `struct Marker;`",
          "Field init shorthand: `Point { x, y }`",
          "Struct update syntax: `Point { ..other }` (moves remaining fields)",
          "`impl` blocks and methods",
