          "Use `async let` to fetch two URLs in parallel and combine the results.",
          "Convert a completion-handler API to async with `withCheckedThrowingContinuation`.",
          "Build an `actor Bank { var balance: Decimal }` with `deposit` and `withdraw` methods; verify no races by spawning 1000 tasks.",
