          "Create an `xcconfig` file with an API base URL and load it into Info.plist via `$(API_BASE_URL)`.",
          "Write a GitHub Actions workflow that runs `xcodebuild test` on macOS.",
          "Install SwiftLint and add a `.swiftlint.yml` with `--strict` enforcement.",
          "Run `xcodebuild -list` on your project and identify the schemes and targets.",
          ">>> QUIZ (Stage 20) <<<",
