          "D) Concatenates two strings",
          "Explanation: `a ?: b` yields `a` when `a` is not null, otherwise `b` — named for its resemblance to Elvis's hair.",
          "Q5: What does `name!!` do?",
          "A) Converts to a non-null type safely",
          "B) Asserts non-null and throws NPE if it is null (*)",
          "C) Returns null if name is null",
          "D) Is the same as `name?.toString()`",
