          "A) x!!use(x)",
          "B) if (x is Any) use(x)",
          "C) x?.let { use(it) } (*)",
          "D) use(x as Any)",
          "Explanation: `x?.let { use(it) }` runs `use` only when `x` is non-null, and inside the lambda `it` is smart-cast to non-null.",
          "----------------------------------------------------------------------"
