          "Add a button that increments a counter stored in `remember { mutableStateOf(0) }` and displays it in a Text.",
          "Move the counter into a `CounterViewModel` exposing `StateFlow`; collect with `collectAsStateWithLifecycle`.",
          "Write a unit test for the ViewModel using `runTest` and Turbine.",
          "Rotate the emulator and verify the count is retained (ViewModel survives).",
          ">>> QUIZ (Stage 20) <<<",
