          "A) Dispatchers.Main",
          "B) Dispatchers.Default",
          "C) Dispatchers.IO (*)",
          "D) Dispatchers.Unconfined",
          "Explanation: `Dispatchers.IO` is for blocking operations (file, network, SQLite); `Main` is for UI, `Default` for CPU work.",
