        "code": "<?php\n// Indexed\n$colors = [\"red\", \"green\", \"blue\"];\n\n// Associative\n$user = [\n    \"name\"  => \"Ada\",\n    \"age\"   => 36,\n    \"roles\" => [\"admin\", \"editor\"],   // nested\n];\n\necho $user[\"roles\"][1];               // \"editor\"\n$user[\"email\"] = \"ada@example.com\";   // add a key\nunset($user[\"age\"]);                  // remove a key",
        "caption": "Indexed, associative, and nested"
