          "Use readxl::excel_sheets() to list sheets in an .xlsx file, then read each into a list of tibbles with purrr::map().",
          "Read a SAS file with haven::read_sas(); inspect tagged NAs with haven::is_tagged_na(); zap them with zap_missing().",
