          "Use pluck() to extract a deep nested value from a list representing a JSON API response; demonstrate NULL vs chuck() error.",
          "Nest iris by Species; fit lm(Petal.Width ~ Petal.Length) per species; unnest broom::tidy() coefficients into a flat tibble.",
          "Use walk() to write 3 small tibbles to disk; explain why walk() is more appropriate than map() here.",
          ">>> QUIZ (Stage 16) <<<",
