          "Strip the .tar.gz extension from a filename using both `${f%.*}` and `${f%%.*}` and observe the difference.",
          "Convert a string to uppercase using `${var^^}` (Bash 4+); verify on macOS Bash 3.2 it fails.",
          "Write a one-liner that prints \"Hello, $USER (pid $$)\" using double quotes and verify the variables interpolate.",
