          "A) The number of words in var",
          "B) The PID of var",
          "C) A hash of var",
          "D) The length of var in characters (*)",
          "Explanation: ${#var} is the string length in bytes/characters (depending on locale).",
          "Q8: What does `export VAR=1` do that `VAR=1` does not?",
          "A) Makes VAR available to child processes (*)",
          "B) Makes VAR read-only",
          "C) Makes VAR a global function",
