          "Q10: Which pattern lets you keep server-rendered data inside an interactive dropdown?",
          "A) Pass the data as a function prop",
          "B) Use a client dropdown that receives server-rendered children (*)",
          "C) Mark the dropdown as 'use server'",
          "D) Use the Pages Router",
