          "Q6: How does DRF parse a JSON body?",
          "A) Automatically into request.data (*)",
          "B) Manually via request.body",
          "C) Into request.POST",
          "D) Into request.json",
          "Explanation: DRF's Request object parses JSON, form, and multipart into request.data based on Content-Type.",
