          "B) LimitOffsetPagination",
          "C) CursorPagination (*)",
          "D) NoPagination",
          "Explanation: CursorPagination uses an opaque cursor (usually a timestamp/id), so inserts during pagination don't shift results. Avoids the \"skip is slow\" problem of offset pagination.",
