          "B) Pass it to the route decorator",
          "C) Add a `__doc__` attribute on the field",
          "D) `Field(description=\"...\")` or docstrings on the model (*)",
          "Explanation: `Field(description=...)` and the model's docstring both flow into the OpenAPI schema.",
          "Q10: Which config setting controls Pydantic v2 model behavior?",
          "A) `model_config = ConfigDict(...)` (*)",
          "B) `class Config:` inner class (v1 style)",
          "C) `__pydantic_config__ = {...}`",
          "D) `Meta.config = {...}`",
          "Explanation: v2 uses `model_config = ConfigDict(...)` as a class attribute; the inner `class Config` from v1 still works but is deprecated.",
