          "Q8: How does a `yield` dependency handle route exceptions?",
          "A) The exception propagates; the `finally` still runs (and `except` around `yield` can catch it) (*)",
          "B) The exception is silently swallowed",
          "C) FastAPI retries the request",
          "D) The dependency is re-invoked",
