          "Explanation: `pytest-asyncio` or `anyio` provides the event loop for `async def` tests.",
          "Q8: What does `ASGITransport(app=app)` do?",
          "A) Sends real HTTP over TCP",
          "B) Compresses the request",
          "C) Routes httpx calls directly to the ASGI app in-process (*)",
          "D) Adds CORS headers",
