          "Use abort(404) inside a view and verify your @app.errorhandler(404) returns JSON.",
          "Return a CSV file from /export with Content-Disposition: attachment; filename=users.csv.",
          ">>> QUIZ (Stage 5) <<<",
          "(Z AI: render this as an interactive multiple-choice quiz in the Learn tab)",
          "Q1: What kind of object is request in Flask?",
          "A) A LocalProxy bound to the current request context (*)",
          "B) A global singleton",
          "C) A class attribute of Flask",
