          "Use `@submit.prevent` on a form and log the form data without reloading the page.",
          "Add an input that responds only to `@keyup.enter` and `@keyup.esc`.",
          "Use `@click.ctrl.exact` to trigger an action only when Ctrl is pressed alone.",
