          "Add a `beforeEach` guard that logs each navigation and redirects unauthenticated users.",
          "Convert one route to a lazy-loaded component and verify the chunk loads on navigation.",
          ">>> QUIZ (Stage 15) <<<",
          "(Z AI: render this as an interactive multiple-choice quiz in the Learn tab)",
          "Q1: Which function creates an HTML5 history-mode router?",
          "A) createHistory()",
          "B) createBrowserHistory()",
          "C) createWebHistory() (*)",
          "D) createWebHashHistory()",
          "Explanation: `createWebHistory()` enables HTML5 history mode (clean URLs); `createWebHashHistory()` uses `#` fragments and needs no server config.",
          "Q2: Which component renders the matched route's component?",
          "A) <RouterLink>",
          "B) <Route>",
          "C) <Outlet>",
          "D) <RouterView> (*)",
          "Explanation: `<RouterView>` renders the component matched by the current route; `<RouterLink>` renders navigation links.",
          "Q3: How do you pass a dynamic segment `/user/:id` to the component as a prop?",
          "A) Set `props: true` on the route (*)",
          "B) Use v-model",
