          "A) useRouter().params",
          "B) this.params",
          "C) useRoute().params (*)",
          "D) $route.params only (no composable)",
          "Explanation: `useRoute()` returns the current reactive route object with `params`, `query`, `path`, etc.; `useRouter()` returns the router instance for navigation.",
