    "title": "Nuxt 3 Basics — SSR, File-Based Routing",
    "description": "Build a Nuxt 3 app with server-side rendering, file-based routing, automatic imports, data fetching with `useFetch`/`useAsyncData`, and SEO meta tags.",
    "difficulty": "advanced",
