          ">>> QUIZ (Stage 19) <<<",
          "(Z AI: render this as an interactive multiple-choice quiz in the Learn tab)",
          "Q1: What is Nuxt 3?",
          "A) A Vue plugin",
          "B) A state management library",
          "C) A meta-framework on Vue 3 with SSR, file-based routing, and conventions (*)",
