          "Q1: Which command scaffolds a new Angular 17+ project?",
          "A) npx @angular/cli@latest new my-app (*)",
          "B) npm install -g angular && angular new my-app",
          "C) npm create angular my-app",
          "D) ng init my-app",
          "Explanation: `npx @angular/cli@latest new my-app` runs the latest Angular CLI without a global install; the CLI prompts for routing, styling, and SSR.",
          "Q2: What is the modern bootstrap entry point for an Angular 17+ standalone-components app?",
          "A) platformBrowserDynamic().bootstrapModule(AppModule)",
          "B) bootstrapApplication(AppComponent, { providers }) (*)",
          "C) createApp(App).mount('#app')",
          "D) angular.bootstrap(AppComponent)",
          "Explanation: `bootstrapApplication` from `@angular/core` boots a standalone root component and registers root-level providers without an NgModule.",
          "Q3: Which decorator marks a class as an Angular component?",
          "A) @Injectable",
          "B) @Directive",
          "C) @Component (*)",
          "D) @NgModule",
          "Explanation: `@Component` is the decorator; `@Directive` is for attribute/structural directives, `@Injectable` for services, `@NgModule` for the legacy module system.",
