          "B) angular.json directly",
          "C) public/index.html",
          "D) src/app/app.module.ts",
          "Explanation: `angular.json` points the browser builder at `src/index.html`, which loads `src/main.ts`; `main.ts` calls `bootstrapApplication` to start the app.",
