          "Use `@ngrx/entity` to manage a list of books with `addOne`, `updateOne`, `removeOne`.",
          "Install `@ngrx/store-devtools` and inspect the action timeline in Redux DevTools.",
          ">>> QUIZ (Stage 11) <<<",
