          "A) Protractor (deprecated)",
          "B) Cypress (*)",
          "C) Selenium only",
          "D) Playwright only",
          "Explanation: Cypress is the modern Angular E2E choice; Protractor (Angular's old built-in) was deprecated. Playwright is also a valid alternative.",
