          "A) cy.mock",
          "B) cy.route (deprecated)",
          "C) cy.intercept (*)",
          "D) cy.stub",
          "Explanation: `cy.intercept(method, url, { body, statusCode })` mocks an HTTP call; `cy.route` was Cypress's old API (deprecated in favor of `intercept`).",
