          "Implement a computed `viewCount` on posts using atomic `$inc`; display a top-20 by views without aggregating.",
          "Add the Extended Reference pattern to an `orders` collection by denormalizing `customer.name`; discuss whether to refresh on customer name change.",
          ">>> QUIZ (Stage 10) <<<",
          "(Z AI: render this as an interactive multiple-choice quiz in the Learn tab)",
          "Q1: What does the Attribute pattern replace?",
          "A) Indexes",
          "B) Hundreds of sparse top-level fields with one `[{ k, v }]` array (*)",
          "C) The _id field",
