          "Write a migration script that creates two indexes; run it as a standalone script (NOT in app boot).",
          "Add `retryWrites=true` and a `withRetry` wrapper to a `findOne` route; verify it survives a replica-set failover.",
          "Implement `/healthz` and `/readyz`; verify `/readyz` returns 503 when MongoDB is unreachable.",
          ">>> QUIZ (Stage 20) <<<",
